# Unicode CLDR 47, locale pl, cldr-dates-full/main/pl/ca-gregorian.json.
# dayPeriods format-wide night1 is "w nocy"; the stand-alone chart gives the
# bare noun "noc".  The locative "nocy" carries the same reading after the
# preposition and is listed so the phrase reads without it.
w nocy
nocy
noc
